    "detailed_description": "Bricks are about to pile up on the surface of the Meow Star. You will drive U.S.S. Toilet Paper to rescue cats.<br />\r\nSmash all kinds of bricks, obtain resources, upgrade weapons and buildings,<br />\r\nDefeat the sudden powerful boss and escape with cats.<br />\r\nCats don't know their situation. If they do something stupid, please forgive them. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRoguelite game core, random weapons and upgrade options, different builds bring different combat experiences.<br />\r\nIt can be played with only one mouse without too fast reaction,<br />\r\nDifferent bricks need different tactics, adjust your build to meet various challenges.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe current game includes:<br />\r\nWeapons: 8<br />\r\nBuilding: 13<br />\r\nUpgrade: 12<br />\r\nCat: 1<br />\r\nSpacecraft: 4<br />\r\nLevel: 3 (9 Modes)<br />\r\nAchievements: 61<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMore content will be added in the future, please look forward to it.",
